  "body": "Beta: test it before 1.12.0 goes to the stable channel and F-Droid.\n\n## Fixes\n- Status: a post that showed two or three times, from copies saved by older versions, is merged into one when Status opens. If one copy was deleted, the post shows once, as deleted.\n- Deleting a long status now removes all of it, its parts included, from your phone and from every archive running this version, so it cannot be rebuilt and reappear.\n- The feed never shows the same XPRS post twice, whatever identifier a copy arrives under.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xprs-dev/app/compare/v1.12.0-beta.2...v1.12.0-beta.3",
